@startuml fig2-4_state_order
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EAF1F8
  BorderColor #2E5A88
  ArrowColor #2E5A88
}

title 图 2-4 订单状态机

[*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT : 买家提交订单\n（幂等键去重 + 库存预占）

PENDING_PAYMENT --> PAID : 支付回调成功\n条件更新 WHERE status=PENDING_PAYMENT
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : 买家主动取消
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : 超时扫描（默认 30 分钟）

PAID --> SHIPPED : 卖家发货\n填写物流单号
SHIPPED --> COMPLETED : 买家确认收货
SHIPPED --> COMPLETED : 发货后 15 天自动确认

PAID --> REFUNDED : 退款审核通过且全额退款
SHIPPED --> REFUNDED : 退款审核通过且全额退款
COMPLETED --> REFUNDED : 退款审核通过且全额退款

CANCELLED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]
REFUNDED --> [*]

note right of PENDING_PAYMENT
  超时时限来自 Nacos 配置
  order.timeout.minutes
end note

note bottom of CANCELLED
  取消后同步释放预占库存；
  释放失败写入补偿表，
  由定时任务退避重试
end note

note bottom of REFUNDED
  仅全额退款进入此状态；
  部分退款不改订单状态
end note

@enduml
